      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "//Syntax\r\n\r\n// access_modifier DataType MethodName(Parameter1, Parameter2, ...) {\r\n//     // Method body\r\n//     // Code to be executed\r\n//     return value; // if the method has a return type other than void\r\n// }\r\n\r\n// Example\r\n\r\npublic String greet(String name) {\r\n    String greeting = \"Hello, \" + name + \"!\";\r\n    return greeting;\r\n}\r\n\r\nSystem.out.println(greet(\"Alice\")); // This will print \"Hello, Alice!\"",
