      "id": "1bbc0100-10a6-44a6-963a-2036b2beec58",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "int index = 3;\r\nArrayList<String> UsersNames = new ArrayList<>();\r\nUsersNames.addAll(Arrays.asList(\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Charlie\",\"David\", \"Eve\", \"Frank\", \"Grace\", \"Heidi\", \"Ivan\", \"Judy\"));\r\n\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Names in the list: \" + UsersNames);\r\n\r\nprotected String FindNameByPosition (int index ,ArrayList<String> names){\r\n    String name = \"\";\r\n    for (int i = 0; i < names.size(); i++){\r\n        if(i == index){\r\n            name = names.get(i);\r\n            break;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    return name;\r\n}\r\nString data = FindNameByPosition(index,UsersNames);\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Name at position \" + index + \" : \" + data);",
